  "notes": "Education is run by Republika Srpska, the ten Federation cantons and Brčko District; all use a 9-year osnovna škola (triads I–III, IV–VI, VII–IX) and a 4-year gimnazija, with the same razred names in Bosnian, Croatian and Serbian. Vocational secondary may last 3 years. Entry is at about 6 (5½–6½); the exact cut-off date differs by jurisdiction."
